<title>USA: Mills, DeBartolo join forces on N.C. mall.</title>
<headline>Mills, DeBartolo join forces on N.C. mall.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group Inc and Mills Corp today announced their intent to build a 1.5 millon square foot super-regional mall in Concord, N.C., near Charlotte for about $180 million.</p>
<p>The companies said that a Mills project typically includes 15 to 20 anchor and major stores and more than 200 specialty retail stores.</p>
</text>
